        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.289,
            0.571,
            0.359
          ],
          "content": "A picture of the chikki broken into 2 pieces is shown below. How much of the original chikki is each piece?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.66,
            0.3,
            0.824,
            0.321
          ],
          "content": "A whole chikki"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.356,
            0.346,
            0.765,
            0.503
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_3_image_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.511,
            0.885,
            0.592
          ],
          "content": "We can see that the bigger piece has 3 pieces of $\\frac { 1 } { 4 }$ chikki in it. So, we can measure the bigger piece using the fractional unit $\\frac { 1 } { 4 } ,$ . We see that the bigger piece is $\\frac{3}{4}$ chikki."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
